#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:2
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:7
msgid ""
"The HVM 1.3 cluster layout introduces a fundamentally new high-availability "
"architecture for |morpheus| hypervisor clusters. The previous Pacemaker-"
"based resource management has been replaced with the |morpheus| agent's "
"QuorumCheckService, providing tighter integration with the |morpheus| "
"platform and simplified operations."
msgstr ""
"El HVM 1.3 cluster layout introduces un fundamentally nuevo alto-"
"disponibilidad architecture para |morpheus| hypervisor clusters. El anterior"
" Pacemaker-based recurso gestión tiene been replaced con el |morpheus| "
"agent's QuorumCheckService, providing tighter integration con el |morpheus| "
"plataforma y simplified operaciones."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:10
msgid "Component Stack"
msgstr "Component Stack"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:12
msgid "The HVM 1.3 cluster relies on three core components:"
msgstr "El HVM 1.3 cluster relies en three núcleo components:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:14
msgid "**Corosync**: Cluster membership and messaging layer"
msgstr "**Corosync**: Clúster membership y messaging layer"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:15
msgid ""
"**DLM (Distributed Lock Manager)**: Coordinates file locks for the HPE "
"Clustered Datastore (GFS2) filesystem"
msgstr ""
"**DLM (Distributed Lock Manager)**: Coordinates archivo locks para el HPE "
"Clustered Almacén de datos (GFS2) filesystem"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Morpheus Agent (QuorumCheckService)**: Quorum decisions, failure "
"detection, fencing, and recovery orchestration"
msgstr ""
"**Morpheus Agent (QuorumCheckService)**: Quorum decisions, fallo detection, "
"fencing, y recuperación orchestration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:19
msgid "Quorum Algorithm"
msgstr "Quorum Algorithm"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:21
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| agent on each host runs a QuorumCheckService that "
"continuously monitors cluster health and makes quorum decisions."
msgstr ""
"El |morpheus| agent en cada host ejecuta un QuorumCheckService ese "
"continuously monitors cluster health y hace quorum decisions."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:24
msgid "Peer Communication"
msgstr "Peer Communication"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:26
msgid "Each host exposes a ``/quorum`` endpoint on port 7443"
msgstr "Cada host exposes un ``/quorum`` endpoint en puerto 7443"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:27
msgid "Hosts ping each other every 20 seconds"
msgstr "Hosts ping cada otro cada 20 seconds"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:28
msgid "A node is considered unreachable after 60 seconds with no response"
msgstr ""
"Un nodo es considered unreachable después de 60 seconds con no respuesta"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:29
msgid ""
"Cross-verification: reachability is confirmed by a majority of same-site "
"peers"
msgstr ""
"Cross-verification: reachability es confirmed por un majority de mismo-site "
"peers"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:32
msgid "Majority Calculation"
msgstr "Majority Calculation"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:34
msgid "The quorum algorithm uses a simple majority formula:"
msgstr "El quorum algorithm usa un simple majority formula:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:36
msgid "neededForQuorum = (totalNodes / 2) + 1"
msgstr "neededForQuorum = (totalNodes / 2) + 1"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:41
msgid "Quorum States"
msgstr "Quorum States"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:43
msgid "Each node operates in one of three states:"
msgstr "Cada nodo operates en one de three estados:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:49
msgid "State"
msgstr "Estado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:50
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:110
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:51
msgid "Quorum Achieved"
msgstr "Quorum Achieved"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:52
msgid "A majority of cluster nodes are reachable. Normal operations continue."
msgstr ""
"Un majority de cluster nodos son reachable. Normal operaciones continuar."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:53
msgid "Quorum Lost"
msgstr "Quorum Lost"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:54
msgid ""
"The node cannot reach a majority of peers. The node self-fences to protect "
"data integrity."
msgstr ""
"El nodo cannot reach un majority de peers. El nodo self-fences a protect "
"datos integrity."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:55
msgid "Fenced"
msgstr "Fenced"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:56
msgid "The node has been fenced and is waiting for recovery."
msgstr "El nodo tiene been fenced y es waiting para recuperación."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:59
msgid "Designated Coordinator"
msgstr "Designated Coordinator"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:61
msgid ""
"The cluster elects a Designated Coordinator from among the reachable nodes. "
"The coordinator is determined by the lowest hash of reachable host key "
"hashes (sorted alphabetically). Only the coordinator is authorized to issue "
"fencing operations."
msgstr ""
"El cluster elects un Designated Coordinator desde among el reachable nodos. "
"El coordinator es determined por el lowest hash de reachable host clave "
"hashes (sorted alphabetically). Solo el coordinator es authorized a problema"
" fencing operaciones."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:64
msgid "Heartbeat Failover (MvmHeartbeatFailover)"
msgstr "Heartbeat Failover (MvmHeartbeatFailover)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:66
msgid ""
"The heartbeat failover mechanism monitors host health via shared storage and"
" orchestrates VM recovery when a host fails."
msgstr ""
"El heartbeat conmutación por error mechanism monitors host health via shared"
" storage y orchestrates VM recuperación cuando un host falla."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:69
msgid "Heartbeat Writes"
msgstr "Heartbeat Writes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:71
msgid "Each host writes ``hb.properties`` to shared storage every 20 seconds"
msgstr "Cada host writes ``hb.properties`` a shared storage cada 20 seconds"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:72
msgid "The heartbeat file contains hostname, memory statistics, and timestamp"
msgstr ""
"El heartbeat archivo contiene hostname, memoria statistics, y timestamp"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:73
msgid ""
"VM XML definitions are written for all running VMs alongside the heartbeat"
msgstr ""
"VM XML definitions son written para todos ejecutando VMs alongside el "
"heartbeat"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:76
msgid "Failure Detection"
msgstr "Fallo Detection"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:78
msgid ""
"A host is considered offline after 140 seconds (7 missed heartbeat "
"intervals)"
msgstr ""
"Un host es considered offline después de 140 seconds (7 missed heartbeat "
"intervals)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:79
msgid ""
"The Designated Coordinator assigns the failed host's VMs to surviving hosts "
"based on available memory"
msgstr ""
"El Designated Coordinator asigna el falló host's VMs a surviving hosts "
"basado en disponible memoria"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:82
msgid "Storage Structure"
msgstr "Storage Structure"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:84
msgid ""
"Heartbeat data is stored on the HPE Clustered Datastore (Shared LUN) at:"
msgstr ""
"Heartbeat datos es stored en el HPE Clustered Almacén de datos (Shared LUN) "
"en:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:86
msgid ""
"<datastore>/mvm-hb/<cluster_uuid>-2/<host_hash>/\n"
"  ├── hb.properties\n"
"  ├── *.xml          (VM definitions)\n"
"  └── recover/"
msgstr ""
"<datastore>/mvm-hb/<cluster_uuid>-2/<host_hash>/\n"
"  ├── hb.properties\n"
"  ├── *.xml          (VM definitions)\n"
"  └── recover/"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:94
msgid "APD (All Paths Down) Protection"
msgstr "APD (Todos Paths Down) Protection"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:96
msgid ""
"APD protection prevents split-brain data corruption when a host loses access"
" to shared storage."
msgstr ""
"APD protection prevents split-brain datos corruption cuando un host loses "
"acceso a shared storage."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:98
msgid ""
"After 6 consecutive failed heartbeat writes (~2 minutes), all non-pinned VMs"
" on shared storage are shut down"
msgstr ""
"Después de 6 consecutive falló heartbeat writes (~2 minutes), todos non-"
"pinned VMs en shared storage son shut down"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:99
msgid ""
"This prevents VMs from running with stale data while another host may be "
"serving the same storage"
msgstr ""
"Este prevents VMs desde ejecutando con stale datos mientras another host "
"puede be serving el mismo storage"

